{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01200",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 3.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.14,
      "end_seconds": 6.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "hi, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.48,
      "end_seconds": 15.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.56,
      "end_seconds": 23.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 24.69,
      "end_seconds": 30.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "She's been having my face drooping on one side, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.81,
      "end_seconds": 33.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.93,
      "end_seconds": 42.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Ever since... since Monday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.41,
      "end_seconds": 46.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.09,
      "end_seconds": 64.38,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "I'd give it it a eight, out of ten. And, And there's a sudden headache as well, six months now. With sudden headache, it comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.56,
      "end_seconds": 69.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Has there been weakness in your right arm too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.76,
      "end_seconds": 80.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since this morning. As for weakness in my right arm, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.61,
      "end_seconds": 83.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat, for about ten years. I have high blood pressure, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.59,
      "end_seconds": 105.89,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "Right, so an irregular heartbeat and high blood pressure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.91,
      "end_seconds": 112.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke. My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.04,
      "end_seconds": 115.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.58,
      "end_seconds": 125.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.11,
      "end_seconds": 128.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.48,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.67,
      "end_seconds": 137.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.17,
      "end_seconds": 142.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.77,
      "end_seconds": 147.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.79,
      "end_seconds": 151.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.24,
      "end_seconds": 160.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.51,
      "end_seconds": 167.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "it's valsartan, 80 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.53,
      "end_seconds": 173.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.95,
      "end_seconds": 182.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.56,
      "end_seconds": 187.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.87,
      "end_seconds": 192.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "no, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.73,
      "end_seconds": 205.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing like seizure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.92,
      "end_seconds": 208.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.09,
      "end_seconds": 213.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "So, any fever or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.19,
      "end_seconds": 216.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.67,
      "end_seconds": 220.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.36,
      "end_seconds": 223.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.7,
      "end_seconds": 229.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.52,
      "end_seconds": 233.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Ah, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.67,
      "end_seconds": 251.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.33,
      "end_seconds": 262.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.2,
      "end_seconds": 281.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 166 over 90, respiratory rate 15, temperature 36.5. And pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.36,
      "end_seconds": 287.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.76,
      "end_seconds": 290.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.48,
      "end_seconds": 310.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Your right face droops, your right arm is weak and your speech is slurred."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.84,
      "end_seconds": 337.89,
      "duration_seconds": 22.05,
      "text": "You can relax now. Taking everything into account, it points towards a possible stroke, within the treatment window. A migraine with aura is also on my list. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had your face drooping on one side, since Monday, and no seizure or loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.89,
      "end_seconds": 339.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.72,
      "end_seconds": 376.49,
      "duration_seconds": 28.77,
      "text": "I'm going to order a blood sugar test, for stroke symptoms. I'm going to order an urgent CT scan of the head, for possible stroke. Call an ambulance now, you need hospital immediately. I think the stroke team should see you too. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.06,
      "end_seconds": 379.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.37,
      "end_seconds": 385.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "let's review you straight away i think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.65,
      "end_seconds": 390.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, uh, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.43,
      "end_seconds": 393.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}